L1: Ketone ester supplementation blunts overreaching symptoms during endurance training overload
L2: The Journal of Physiology (2019)
L3: Chiel Poffé, Monique Ramaekers, Ruud Van Thienen, Peter Hespel
L4: 1 
L5:  Exercise Physiology Research Group 
L6:  Department of Movement Sciences 
L7:  KU Leuven 
L8:  Leuven 
